  "details": "On the https://vrchat.com/home/groups page, only the groups I own appear at the very top.\n\nGroups that I am part of, am an administrator in, but do not own, get buried with no organization under \"Joined Groups\".\n\nI could use something that lets me put other groups I'm in and need to access often near the top.\n\nThis is very similar to https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/show-groups-i-admin-moderate-at-top-of-groups-list-on-the-website\n\nBecause that's pretty much why I would want it at the top.\n\nBut who knows maybe someone just wants to pin their favorite group too to read the announcements in-website?",
